{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想準確掌握距離重要日子還有多久，Countdown 可把倒數細分至星期、日、小時、分鐘與秒數，適合需要追蹤生日、紀念日或項目截止時間的用家。程式原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，並提供無廣告的使用體驗。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-22.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>倒數計時與通知提醒</h2>\n\n\n<p>Countdown 除了計算剩餘日數，亦細分至小時、分鐘與秒數，讓用家清楚掌握距離生日、紀念日或截止時間尚有多少。程式支援無限個倒數事件，並以本地通知提醒，避免錯過任何安排。內置多款背景圖片，可自行配搭出順眼的介面風格。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-1.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-2.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-3.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2208bb-4.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Countdown - Weeks, Days, Hours, Minutes and Seconds Counter</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/countdown-weeks-days-hours-minutes-and-seconds-counter/id1001957790?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.225434+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:46:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"613248a295d651f8d3b0a894d2fe1581eaf46a6a57c162f413226b58dacfb431","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}